From: =?utf-8?b?T25kxZllaiBTdXLDvQ==?= <ondrej@sury.org>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 09:24:33 +0100
Subject: Backport the dba test fixes from PHP 7.0

Four test fixes of December 2013 only went into the branch that became
PHP 7.0, so these tests fail in PHP 5.6: db4 no longer reports an
"unexpected file type or format" notice for an existing file, the inifile
handler accepts a second value for a key, and magic_quotes_runtime was
removed in PHP 5.4. Backport of upstream commits f0c85fab45b (the two db4
tests), b0415856fdd, a7f0465c0b2 and f4912e3a96b.
